l temple open to the public?','[\"Bhai Tika during Tihar\", \"Buddha Jayanti\", \"New Year\", \"Every Monday\"]',0,3,1100,'The temple opens only on Bhai Tika, the last day of Tihar.','बीचको मन्दिर सर्वसाधारणका लागि कुन दिन खुल्छ?','[\"तिहारको भाइटीकाका दिन\", \"बुद्ध जयन्ती\", \"नयाँ वर्ष\", \"हरेक सोमबार\"]','बीचको मन्दिर तिहारको अन्तिम दिन भाइटीकामा मात्र खुल्छ।',0,0),(575,58,'Which statue stands on the pond\'s southern bank?','[\"A stone elephant with the king and his sons\", \"A golden Garuda\", \"A bronze lion\", \"A giant Hanuman\"]',0,4,1250,'The elephant bears images of the king and his two sons.','पोखरीको दक्षिणी किनारमा कुन मूर्ति छ?','[\"राजा र उनका छोरासहित ढुङ्गाको हात्ती\", \"सुनको गरुड\", \"काँसाको सिंह\", \"विशाल हनुमान\"]','हात्तीमा राजा र उनका दुई छोराको मूर्ति छ।',0,0),(576,58,'What shape is Rani Pokhari?','[\"Round\", \"Triangular\", \"Square\", \"Star-shaped\"]',2,1,800,'It is a large square artificial tank.','रानी पोखरी कुन आकारको छ?','[\"गोलो\", \"त्रिकोण\", \"वर्गाकार\", \"तारा आकारको\"]','यो ठूलो वर्गाकार कृत्रिम पोखरी हो।',0,0),(577,58,'What stands in the middle of the pond?','[\"A Buddhist stupa\", \"A palace\", \"A clock tower\", \"A Shiva temple\"]',3,1,800,'A Shiva temple stands in the middle, reached by a causeway.','पोखरीको बीचमा के छ?','[\"बौद्ध स्तूप\", \"दरबार\", \"घण्टाघर\", \"शिव मन्दिर\"]','बीचमा पुलबाट पुगिने शिव मन्दिर छ।',0,0),(578,58,'Which animal trampled the royal son to death, causing the queen\'s grief?','[\"An elephant\", \"A tiger\", \"A horse\", \"A bull\"]',0,1,800,'The queen was overcome with grief after their son was trampled by an elephant.','कुन जनावरले राजकुमारलाई कुल्चेर मार्दा रानी शोकमा डुबिन्?','[\"हात्ती\", \"बाघ\", \"घोडा\", \"साँढे\"]','हात्तीले छोरालाई कुल्चेर मारेपछि रानी शोकले विह्वल भइन्।',0,0),(579,58,'Water from which holy place was poured into the pond to sanctify it?','[\"Lumbini\", \"Phewa lake\", \"Gosaikunda\", \"Taudaha\"]',2,2,950,'The king had water brought from sacred places including Gosai